OL,3,ARaise The Colours member guilty of
OL,4,Adancefloor murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of activist group Raise The
OL,7,FColours has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurdering a pub landlord who died after
OL,9,Fbeing punched in the neck on the
OL,10,Fdancefloor at a bar.
OL,12,FMatthew O'Gara, 44, was attacked by
OL,13,FBilly Allison at Rico and Loren bar in
OL,14,FLichfield, Staffordshire, on 24 May.
OL,16,FAllison was also found guilty of
OL,17,Fcausing grievous bodily harm with
OL,18,Fintent to O'Gara's friend Adam Cooper,
OL,19,F62, who was punched twice and was left
OL,20,Fwith a fractured eye socket and nose.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
